@startuml 使用案例7_3_忘記密碼
title 使用案例7.3: 忘記密碼流程

actor "已註冊使用者" as RegisteredUser
participant "ForgotPassword.vue" as ForgotPasswordPage
participant "client.ts" as APIClient
participant "auth.py" as AuthBlueprint
participant "auth_service.py" as AuthService
participant "email_service.py" as EmailService
participant "audit_service.py" as AuditService
participant "User Model" as UserModel
database "MySQL" as Database

== Stage 1: 進入忘記密碼頁面 ==
RegisteredUser -> ForgotPasswordPage: 從登入頁點選「忘記密碼」\n訪問 /forgot-password
activate ForgotPasswordPage
ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: 顯示忘記密碼表單\nemail, success, error, loading 初始化
note right of ForgotPasswordPage
  初始狀態:
  - email = ''
  - success = false
  - error = ''
  - loading = false
end note

== Stage 2: 輸入 Email ==
RegisteredUser -> ForgotPasswordPage: 輸入註冊的 Email
activate RegisteredUser
ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: v-model 綁定 email
note right of ForgotPasswordPage
  表單提示:
  「輸入您的 email，我們將發送
  重置密碼的連結」
end note

== Stage 3: 提交重設請求 ==
RegisteredUser -> ForgotPasswordPage: 按下「發送重設連結」按鈕
ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: 觸發 handleSubmit()
ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: 驗證 email 不為空
ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: 設定 loading = true

== Stage 4: 呼叫忘記密碼 API ==
ForgotPasswordPage -> APIClient: api.post('/auth/forgot-password',\n{ email: email.value })
activate APIClient
APIClient -> AuthBlueprint: POST /auth/forgot-password\nBody: { "email": "user@example.com" }
activate AuthBlueprint

== Stage 5: 後端欄位驗證 ==
AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 解析 JSON Body\ndata = request.get_json()
AuthBlueprint -> AuthBlueprint: 驗證 email 欄位存在
alt Email 欄位缺失
  AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 400 Bad Request\n{ "message": "Email 為必填" }
  APIClient --> ForgotPasswordPage: 拋出錯誤
  ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: error = "Email 為必填"
  ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: loading = false
  ForgotPasswordPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示錯誤訊息
  deactivate APIClient
  deactivate AuthBlueprint
else Email 欄位存在 (繼續)
end

== Stage 6: 呼叫密碼重置服務 ==
AuthBlueprint -> AuthService: request_password_reset(email)
activate AuthService
note right of AuthService
  安全設計:
  無論 email 是否存在，
  都返回成功訊息
  (避免暴露用戶存在性)
end note

== Stage 7: 查詢使用者 ==
AuthService -> UserModel: User.query.filter_by(email=email).first()
activate UserModel
UserModel -> Database: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE email = :email\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
activate Database
Database --> UserModel: 返回 User 記錄 or None
deactivate Database
UserModel --> AuthService: user 對象 or None
deactivate UserModel

== Stage 8: 檢查使用者是否存在 ==
alt 使用者不存在
  AuthService -> AuthService: 為安全考量，返回 True\n(不暴露用戶不存在)
  note right of AuthService
    安全考量:
    即使用戶不存在也返回成功
    防止惡意探測 email 是否註冊
  end note
  AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: return True (不發送郵件)
  AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 200 OK\n{ "message": "如果該 email 存在，\n密碼重置郵件已發送" }
  APIClient --> ForgotPasswordPage: 返回成功
  ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: success = true
  ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: loading = false
  ForgotPasswordPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示成功訊息 (綠色)\n「郵件已發送」
  deactivate AuthService
  deactivate AuthBlueprint
  deactivate APIClient
  deactivate RegisteredUser
else 使用者存在 (繼續)
end

== Stage 9: 生成密碼重置 Token ==
AuthService -> AuthService: token = generate_verification_token(\nuser.user_id,\npurpose='password-reset')
note right of AuthService
  Token 生成:
  - 包含 user_id
  - 用途: 'password-reset'
  - 有效期: 1 小時 (3600秒)
  使用 itsdangerous 簽名
end note

== Stage 10: 發送密碼重置郵件 ==
AuthService -> EmailService: send_password_reset_email(\nuser_email=user.email,\nusername=user.username,\ntoken=token)
activate EmailService
EmailService -> EmailService: 取得 FRONTEND_URL 配置\nreset_url = frontend_url + \n'/reset-password?token=' + token
note right of EmailService
  郵件內容:
  - 主旨: "[App] 重置密碼"
  - 重置連結: 
    http://localhost:5173/reset-password?token=xxx
  - 有效期: 1 小時
end note

EmailService -> EmailService: 組裝郵件內容\n主旨: "[App] 重置密碼"\nBody: 重置連結 + token
EmailService -> EmailService: _send_via_smtp(\nsubject, user_email, body)
note right of EmailService
  透過 SMTP 發送郵件
  (或 console 輸出)
end note
EmailService --> AuthService: return True (郵件已發送)
deactivate EmailService

== Stage 11: 返回成功 ==
AuthService --> AuthBlueprint: return True
deactivate AuthService
AuthBlueprint --> APIClient: 200 OK\n{ "message": "如果該 email 存在，\n密碼重置郵件已發送" }
deactivate AuthBlueprint
APIClient --> ForgotPasswordPage: 返回成功響應
deactivate APIClient

== Stage 12: 顯示成功訊息 ==
ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: success = true
ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: loading = false
ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: 隱藏表單，顯示成功訊息區塊
ForgotPasswordPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示綠色成功訊息:\n「郵件已發送」\n「如果該 email 存在於系統中，\n您將收到密碼重置連結」\n「請檢查您的郵箱（包括垃圾郵件）」
note right of ForgotPasswordPage
  用戶體驗:
  - 提供返回登入頁面連結
  - 成功訊息保持中立
    (不透露 email 是否存在)
end note

== Stage 13: 使用者檢查郵箱 ==
RegisteredUser -> RegisteredUser: 檢查郵箱 (包括垃圾郵件資料夾)
note right of RegisteredUser
  郵件內容:
  - 重置連結 (含 token)
  - 有效期提醒: 1 小時
  點選連結進入重置密碼頁面
  (使用案例 7.3.1)
end note

== Stage 14: 錯誤處理 ==
alt 網路錯誤或後端錯誤
  APIClient --> ForgotPasswordPage: 拋出錯誤 (500 等)
  ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: error = "發送失敗，請稍後再試"
  ForgotPasswordPage -> ForgotPasswordPage: loading = false
  ForgotPasswordPage --> RegisteredUser: 顯示紅色錯誤訊息
  deactivate RegisteredUser
end

deactivate ForgotPasswordPage

note over RegisteredUser, Database
  **安全機制:**
  1. 總是返回成功訊息 (不暴露 email 存在性)
  2. Token 有效期 1 小時 (max_age=3600)
  3. Token 單次使用 (重置後失效)
  4. 24 小時內最多請求 5 次 (防止濫用) - 需實作
  5. 郵件中包含安全提示
  
  **後續流程:**
  使用者點選郵件連結 → 進入 ResetPassword.vue
  → 輸入新密碼 → POST /auth/reset-password
  → 驗證 token → 更新密碼 → 重置失敗登入次數
  → 記錄審計日誌 → 完成重置
  
  **資料變更:**
  - 無資料庫變更 (僅發送郵件)
  - Token 存在於 JWT 簽名中 (無需存儲)
  
  **相關使用案例:**
  - 7.3.1: 重置密碼 (輸入新密碼)
  - 7.2: 使用者登入 (重置後使用新密碼登入)
end note

@enduml